applied to the pinned commit by mineai/fetch-and-patch.sh (or scripts/mineai-fetch.mjs); git apply skips these lines.
0012: reflex toggles, so the player (Muse) decides what the body does by itself. food.reflex: full (their rule, the
default: eat at hunger 14 or less, or when hurt below the regeneration bar), starving (hunger 4 or less only) or never;
navigation.escape_reflexes (default true): false keeps the breath, fire and footing reflexes from acting. Both are
policy fields, set with set_survival_policy. Explicit eat_food and navigate requests are never affected. With tests
(hunger, breath).

